        "step_anchor": "step-1",
        "title": "Introduction",
        "key_prerequisites": [],
        "has_content_in_snapshot": true,
        "sections": [
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p>The <strong>difference of squares formula</strong> states the product of the sum and the difference of two monomials is equal to the difference of their squares:</p>",
            "readable_text": "The difference of squares formula states the product of the sum and the difference of two monomials is equal to the difference of their squares:",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p><span class=\"math\">[MATH: (a + b)(a - b) = a^2 - b^2]</span></p>",
            "readable_text": "[MATH: (a + b)(a - b) = a^2 - b^2]",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p>We can check that this result is correct by expanding the binomial in the usual way, as follows:</p>",
            "readable_text": "We can check that this result is correct by expanding the binomial in the usual way, as follows:",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p><span class=\"math\">[MATH: \\eqalign{\n({\\color{blue}a} + {\\color{red}b})(a - b) &amp;= \\[5pt]\n{\\color{blue}a}(a - b) + {\\color{red}b}(a - b) &amp;= \\[5pt]\na^2 - ab + ab - b^2 &amp;= \\[5pt]\na^2 - b^2 \\,&amp; {\\color{green}{\\checkmark}}\n}]</span></p>",
            "readable_text": "[MATH: \\eqalign{\n({\\color{blue}a} + {\\color{red}b})(a - b) &= \\[5pt]\n{\\color{blue}a}(a - b) + {\\color{red}b}(a - b) &= \\[5pt]\na^2 - ab + ab - b^2 &= \\[5pt]\na^2 - b^2 \\,& {\\color{green}{\\checkmark}}\n}]",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p>Notice that the middle two terms <span class=\"math\">[MATH: - ab]</span> and <span class=\"math\">[MATH: ab]</span> cancel each other out, leaving only <span class=\"math\">[MATH: a^2 - b^2.]</span> </p>",
            "readable_text": "Notice that the middle two terms [MATH: - ab] and [MATH: ab] cancel each other out, leaving only [MATH: a^2 - b^2.]",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p>If the order of multiplication is switched, the formula still remains the same:\n<span class=\"math\">[MATH: (a - b)(a + b) = a^2 - b^2]</span></p>",
            "readable_text": "If the order of multiplication is switched, the formula still remains the same:\n[MATH: (a - b)(a + b) = a^2 - b^2]",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          }
        ],
        "images": [],
        "free_entry_blanks": [],
        "select_lists": [],
        "readable_text": "Content:\nThe difference of squares formula states the product of the sum and the difference of two monomials is equal to the difference of their squares:\n\nContent:\n[MATH: (a + b)(a - b) = a^2 - b^2]\n\nContent:\nWe can check that this result is correct by expanding the binomial in the usual way, as follows:\n\nContent:\n[MATH: \\eqalign{\n({\\color{blue}a} + {\\color{red}b})(a - b) &= \\[5pt]\n{\\color{blue}a}(a - b) + {\\color{red}b}(a - b) &= \\[5pt]\na^2 - ab + ab - b^2 &= \\[5pt]\na^2 - b^2 \\,& {\\color{green}{\\checkmark}}\n}]\n\nContent:\nNotice that the middle two terms [MATH: - ab] and [MATH: ab] cancel each other out, leaving only [MATH: a^2 - b^2.]\n\nContent:\nIf the order of multiplication is switched, the formula still remains the same:\n[MATH: (a - b)(a + b) = a^2 - b^2]"
      },
      {
