        "sections": [
          {
            "section_type": "example_question",
            "normalized_html": "<p>Expand <span class=\"math\">[MATH: (x + 3)(x - 3).]</span></p>",
            "readable_text": "Expand [MATH: (x + 3)(x - 3).]",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p>EXPLANATION</p>",
            "readable_text": "EXPLANATION",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "example_explanation",
            "normalized_html": "<p>We will use the difference of square formula:</p><p><span class=\"math\">[MATH: (a + b)(a - b) = a^2 - b^2]</span></p><p>Substituting <span class=\"math\">[MATH: a=x]</span> and <span class=\"math\">[MATH: b=3,]</span> we have</p><p><span class=\"math\">[MATH: \\eqalign{\n(x + 3)(x - 3) &amp;= \\[5pt]\nx^2 - 3^2 &amp;= \\[5pt]\nx^2 - 9.\n}]</span></p>",
            "readable_text": "We will use the difference of square formula:\n\n[MATH: (a + b)(a - b) = a^2 - b^2]\n\nSubstituting [MATH: a=x] and [MATH: b=3,] we have\n\n[MATH: \\eqalign{\n(x + 3)(x - 3) &= \\[5pt]\nx^2 - 3^2 &= \\[5pt]\nx^2 - 9.\n}]",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          }
        ],
        "images": [],
        "free_entry_blanks": [],
        "select_lists": [],
        "readable_text": "Example Prompt:\nExpand [MATH: (x + 3)(x - 3).]\n\nContent:\nEXPLANATION\n\nExplanation:\nWe will use the difference of square formula:\n\n[MATH: (a + b)(a - b) = a^2 - b^2]\n\nSubstituting [MATH: a=x] and [MATH: b=3,] we have\n\n[MATH: \\eqalign{\n(x + 3)(x - 3) &= \\[5pt]\nx^2 - 3^2 &= \\[5pt]\nx^2 - 9.\n}]"
      },
